.claude/settings.local.json
# --- Internal hand-off notes (absolute local paths, agent workflow) ---
HANDOFF.md

# --- Markdown: only what the public repo and the site need (owner's rule, 11 Nov 2026) ---
# Internal planning/spec notes (plans, scorecards, notices, governance) stay local.
*.md
!README.md
!theme/README.md
# Site content: docs/guides/*.md are rendered into /guides/<slug> pages at build time.
!docs/guides/
!docs/guides/*.md
# The negation above re-includes macOS AppleDouble copies (._name.md): exclude them again.
docs/guides/._*
# GitHub folder (owner, 25 Nov 2026): CI and Pages workflows, issue/PR templates, Dependabot, CODEOWNERS are public.
# The PR template is Markdown, so it is re-included here; the rest of .github/ is yml and is not matched by `*.md`.
!.github/pull_request_template.md
.github/**/._*
# Public project docs (owner, 16 and 25 Nov 2026): GitHub community standards, license notices, contributing guide, changelog.
# Planning, scoring, motion, SEO and hand-off notes (PLAN, TASKS, QUALITY, MOTION, SEO, HANDOFF, CLAUDE) stay local.
!SECURITY.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CHANGELOG.md
# Test fixtures of the guide code check: `pnpm scripts:test` needs them in a fresh clone.
!scripts/test/fixtures/**/*.md
scripts/test/fixtures/**/._*

# --- Never pushed (owner, 16 Nov 2026) ---
# Editor settings stay local (public docs describe the formatting rules in their own words).
.editorconfig
# Design lab prototypes (hero options, stage and OTP concepts): kept locally as a reference, dev server only.
demo/dist-lab/
# A macOS "XSym" symlink stub copied from a Mac: it holds a local machine path.
demo/playwright-core
# Demo videos and screen recordings: shared via releases or social posts, not the repo.
*.webm
*.mp4
*.mov

# Hand-off bundle between machines (agent reports, briefs, design references): local only.
.handoff/
*.tmp.mjs
.w9*-verify.mjs
.scan-tmp.mjs
